Hi Patrick,

Before we start looking at the handoffs by job title, can we take the October=
 novice sketch out of the working set? Brian and I found four people who had =
handled both ordinary and exception handoffs on their own and still returned =
to the screen to check what it showed against information from another source=
. That's enough to drop the idea that this was specific to people new to the =
desk.

I've attached the short write-up (CWR-DR-20250124-RPT-01). It puts each perso=
n's handoff experience alongside the particular check they made. Please use t=
hat for the review and leave the October sketch in its withdrawn version.

Thanks,
Jennifer

